WEBVTT

00:01.680 --> 00:04.600
It's hard to believe that Yuzuru disappeared.

00:06.200 --> 00:08.240
At midnight last night,

00:08.240 --> 00:11.240
the moment the date changed, Yuzuru was gone.

00:12.860 --> 00:16.200
So Natsumi really is one of the twelve people?

00:17.020 --> 00:22.780
Until I figure out who she is,
she's gonna make someone disappear each day?

00:22.780 --> 00:24.500
Most likely.

00:24.920 --> 00:27.700
The longer this goes, the easier it will be to guess who she is,

00:27.700 --> 00:30.260
but that also means more people will have disappeared.

00:31.560 --> 00:34.140
I've gotta find her.

00:34.140 --> 00:35.560
For everyone's sake.

00:35.560 --> 00:37.720
And for Natsumi's sake too.

00:38.360 --> 00:44.480
Then how about you get right to finding out if I'm the real Itsuka Kotori or not.

00:45.120 --> 00:47.220
You're the real one.

00:47.220 --> 00:49.940
That's what I want to believe, at least.

00:50.260 --> 00:52.520
Is this really the time to get sloppy?

00:52.520 --> 00:55.030
There are tons of ways to be absolutely certain.

00:55.320 --> 00:57.480
Asking me questions, for instance.

00:57.480 --> 01:00.290
O-Or to judge based on my reactions,

01:00.840 --> 01:04.040
y-you could k-kiss me, or something.

01:05.040 --> 01:06.040
Right.

01:06.560 --> 01:07.540
Okay then...

01:09.040 --> 01:10.940
Sh-Shidou...

01:15.300 --> 01:18.060
What are you doing, Onii-chan?!

01:18.060 --> 01:21.240
Give them back!

01:20.300 --> 01:22.540
Yep, it really is you.

01:21.240 --> 01:25.160
Onii-chan! Give them back! Give them back!

01:22.540 --> 01:27.980
There's no way Natsumi could mimic you this perfectly... right, Kotori?

01:28.380 --> 01:30.730
Uh... Kotori-san?

01:35.500 --> 01:38.520
You want to have more dates today?

01:36.030 --> 01:40.450
Episode 3

01:36.030 --> 01:40.450
You're Natsumi

01:38.520 --> 01:39.540
Yes.

01:39.540 --> 01:43.140
I know the schedule's already packed as it is.

01:43.140 --> 01:47.000
But I want to save even one more person if I can.

01:47.340 --> 01:49.920
Please help me with the schedule.

01:49.920 --> 01:53.100
Understood. I'll do what I can.

01:53.100 --> 01:56.500
For now, go to your date with Miku as scheduled.

01:56.500 --> 01:58.260
Thank you!

01:59.100 --> 02:03.120
H-Hey, Miku, why are we going on a date dressed like this?

02:03.120 --> 02:04.520
You could've told me beforehand!

02:04.520 --> 02:10.020
Well, I am an idol, so it'd be bad if somebody recognized me, right?

02:10.580 --> 02:12.160
Don't worry.

02:12.160 --> 02:15.530
They're allowing people to cosplay here today.

02:15.530 --> 02:20.530
We're finally going on a date, so we don't want anyone getting in the way of our fun, do we?

02:20.820 --> 02:23.030
Yeah, you have a point there.

02:23.030 --> 02:27.290
Wow, it's Tsukishima Kanon-chan and Sieg-sama from Valkyrie Misty!

02:27.600 --> 02:31.760
They're wearing the rare outfits from when they rescued Misty in episode six, aren't they?!

02:31.760 --> 02:33.620
Please let us take a picture!

02:33.620 --> 02:34.300
U-Uh,

02:34.600 --> 02:35.900
actually, we're—

02:35.900 --> 02:37.670
Sure, go ahead!

02:41.820 --> 02:43.840
Come on Darling, get over here!

02:43.840 --> 02:45.180
H-Huh?!

02:49.020 --> 02:53.270
That's it! The signature Sieg pose! He's so dreamy!

02:53.760 --> 02:54.650
So...

02:54.650 --> 02:57.320
what'd you call us out here for?

02:57.320 --> 03:00.780
If you're trying to get back on our good side after what you did, think again.

03:00.780 --> 03:02.160
So gross.

03:02.680 --> 03:05.420
No, that's not what I'm here for.

03:05.420 --> 03:09.060
We're classmates, you know?
I thought we could just talk...

03:09.060 --> 03:10.840
or something.

03:12.340 --> 03:15.380
Wh-What brings you here, Itsuka-kun?

03:15.780 --> 03:19.060
All you said was you wanted to discuss your future plans with me.

03:19.060 --> 03:21.130
U-Uh, well...

03:21.900 --> 03:25.390
I think it's about time I really thought about my future.

03:26.020 --> 03:28.000
Oh, I see.

03:29.520 --> 03:35.900
I haven't forgotten the promise you made to me back then, Itsuka-kun.

03:41.900 --> 03:43.360
You're kidding!

03:44.280 --> 03:45.410
You see that, Shidou?

03:45.800 --> 03:47.420
That was my special move

03:47.420 --> 03:49.940
Dunkelheit Windhaus!

03:52.120 --> 03:54.170
In addition to my special move,

03:54.580 --> 03:58.760
I am also equiped with the
legendary divine gauntlet, Fegefeuer.

03:58.760 --> 04:01.800
You never stood a chance, Shidou.

04:01.800 --> 04:03.820
Huh? Legendary?

04:03.820 --> 04:06.680
You just bought it over there...

04:08.080 --> 04:10.920
I trust you haven't forgotten our arrangement?

04:10.920 --> 04:15.060
Loser obeys the victor.

04:15.780 --> 04:17.320
I know.

04:17.740 --> 04:20.570
This is where I turn it around!

04:20.570 --> 04:23.490
Itsuka Shidou, defeated!

04:25.500 --> 04:27.180
Now sit.

04:27.180 --> 04:28.240
O-Okay.

04:32.300 --> 04:33.620
Now heed my order.

04:34.000 --> 04:35.640
Swear that for the next ten minutes

04:35.640 --> 04:39.750
you will listen to my orders with absolute servility and obedience, without faltering.

04:40.160 --> 04:42.510
And swear that you will not tell a single soul of this.

04:42.940 --> 04:43.590
Huh?

04:46.840 --> 04:48.620
O-Okay.

04:48.620 --> 04:49.640
I swear.

04:49.640 --> 04:50.760
Very well.

04:52.980 --> 04:55.780
Quite comfortable, if I do say so myself.

04:55.780 --> 04:58.980
You have the potential to be my personal pillow.

04:59.380 --> 05:00.980
R-Really?

05:01.420 --> 05:03.240
You lost. Are you complaining?

05:03.660 --> 05:07.040
Now, perhaps I'll have you pat my head as well.

05:07.040 --> 05:08.760
Yes, my liege.

05:18.280 --> 05:20.640
Uh... Kaguya?

05:25.340 --> 05:26.760
Yuzuru...

05:27.240 --> 05:29.000
Yuzuru...

05:27.700 --> 05:30.260
Kaguya, you...

05:30.820 --> 05:35.420
They said she's having tests done,
but she's actually missing, isn't she?

05:35.420 --> 05:39.200
Even I can tell that! Don't treat me like I'm stupid!

05:39.200 --> 05:40.650
I...

05:41.000 --> 05:44.920
But, ignorance is bliss, right?

05:44.920 --> 05:46.820
That's why I'll believe you.

05:46.820 --> 05:53.440
You're the one who gave
Yuzuru and me a third choice back then.

05:53.440 --> 05:54.540
Kaguya...

05:55.220 --> 05:57.020
So, please...

05:57.020 --> 05:58.860
Bring...

05:58.860 --> 06:00.580
Bring her...

06:02.260 --> 06:05.050
"Geez, you're pathetic."

06:05.320 --> 06:08.580
Is something I'll skip saying today.

06:08.580 --> 06:12.660
You pushed the schedule to the limit and have had dates with eleven people now.

06:12.660 --> 06:14.940
I can't blame you for being tired.

06:14.940 --> 06:17.940
Well, it was my choice.

06:18.340 --> 06:22.190
So, did any of them stand out to you?

06:22.580 --> 06:24.940
I'm not sure.

06:24.940 --> 06:27.820
Miku and Kaguya are definitely real.

06:27.820 --> 06:31.450
Even Yamabuki and the others were normal.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.450
This is tough.

06:34.080 --> 06:36.260
I want to reach the answer.

06:36.260 --> 06:38.720
But it can't be that none of them are Natsumi.

06:39.460 --> 06:40.960
Exactly.

06:41.240 --> 06:45.090
It's about time to give our answer.

06:45.440 --> 06:46.700
Yeah,

06:46.700 --> 06:51.340
but even if I wanted to,
how am I supposed to deliver it?

06:51.340 --> 06:53.720
She never really specified that either.

06:54.100 --> 06:58.480
This game is run purely by Natsumi's whims.

06:58.480 --> 07:02.380
I'm sure that she's watching us, but...

07:02.380 --> 07:04.110
Bingo!

07:05.860 --> 07:06.920
Kotori!

07:10.320 --> 07:11.610
Natsumi!

07:11.610 --> 07:13.780
Hi, Shidou-kun.

07:13.780 --> 07:16.200
Day two of the game is over.

07:16.200 --> 07:18.820
Having fun yet?

07:18.820 --> 07:20.860
Why are you doing this?

07:20.860 --> 07:23.120
I never asked to play this game!

07:23.120 --> 07:26.630
Give Yuzuru back and we can talk about this!

07:26.630 --> 07:28.280
No can do.

07:28.280 --> 07:33.720
You might not want to play,
but the wheels are already in motion.

07:33.720 --> 07:38.890
How about you give me your answer for today. Who am I?

07:38.890 --> 07:40.740
You're...

07:41.400 --> 07:44.900
Shidou, even if you don't answer,
someone will disappear.

07:45.280 --> 07:47.020
It's all or nothing. Just guess.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.660
You're masquerading as...

07:54.480 --> 07:55.910
Yoshino!

07:56.340 --> 08:00.580
I don't have any solid evidence,
but maybe that forwardness was...

08:03.660 --> 08:04.330
I see.

08:05.600 --> 08:06.340
Natsumi, wait!

08:06.820 --> 08:07.880
She disappeared!

08:07.880 --> 08:09.680
Does that mean you were right?

08:09.680 --> 08:12.880
Shin, Kotori, can you hear me?

08:12.880 --> 08:14.590
Reine, what's wrong?

08:15.000 --> 08:19.920
Natsumi's Angel made another person from the pictures disappear.

08:21.120 --> 08:23.360
Yamabuki Ai and Yoshino have disappeared.

08:29.260 --> 08:30.980
Two days later...

08:30.980 --> 08:33.340
I still hadn't guessed who Natsumi was.

08:33.340 --> 08:39.660
Okamine-sensei, Hazakura Mai,
Fujibakama Mii, and Tonomachi were all gone.

08:39.660 --> 08:42.460
Shin, you're almost at your destination.

08:42.900 --> 08:45.060
Sorry, did you wait long?

08:45.060 --> 08:46.460
No, I just got here.

08:46.960 --> 08:51.540
We were surveilling her just in case,
and she's been waiting there for an hour.

08:52.760 --> 08:54.640
So, what should we watch?

08:54.640 --> 08:57.850
I hadn't really thought about it...

08:58.160 --> 08:59.460
What you're saying is

08:59.460 --> 09:02.780
you invited me to watch a movie with you not because you wanted to watch a movie,

09:02.780 --> 09:05.580
but because you wanted to spend time with me?

09:05.580 --> 09:09.760
Uh... yeah, I guess you could say that.

09:14.400 --> 09:15.960
How far are we going to go?

09:15.960 --> 09:17.110
As far as we can.

09:19.900 --> 09:21.060
<i>Origami?</i>

09:29.680 --> 09:30.710
What—

09:31.900 --> 09:33.460
I want you to touch them.

09:34.320 --> 09:35.970
I'm not wearing a bra today.

09:36.740 --> 09:38.970
A-Are you serious?!

09:48.360 --> 09:49.800
So tired...

09:49.800 --> 09:51.280
both physically and mentally.

09:51.280 --> 09:52.480
Shido!

09:52.840 --> 09:55.600
Tohka? What are you doing out so late?

09:55.600 --> 09:57.740
That's what I wanted to ask you.

09:57.740 --> 10:00.940
You've been really busy these last few days.

10:00.940 --> 10:02.740
I'm a little worried.

10:04.500 --> 10:05.920
Sorry!

10:05.920 --> 10:07.640
You don't have to apologize!

10:07.640 --> 10:10.980
You have your own things that you have to do.

10:11.680 --> 10:15.680
But I wish I could see you more.

10:15.680 --> 10:18.260
If there's anything I can do to help, just say the word!

10:18.820 --> 10:21.200
Thank you, Tohka.

10:21.200 --> 10:23.140
Hearing that has energized me!

10:23.140 --> 10:25.440
That's great!

10:25.440 --> 10:26.360
Yeah!

10:29.600 --> 10:31.640
Sorry to interrupt.

10:31.640 --> 10:34.900
Are we on the right track to get to Tenguu Street?

10:35.200 --> 10:36.640
Y-Yeah.

10:36.640 --> 10:39.240
Just take a left at the second set of lights from here.

10:39.600 --> 10:42.420
Thanks. Our GPS is broken.

10:42.420 --> 10:45.490
You sure are lifesavers, you lovebirds.

10:49.340 --> 10:51.750
Did that sound forced?

10:52.220 --> 10:54.500
I don't believe they suspected a thing.

10:56.060 --> 11:00.510
So that's Itsuka Shidou and Princess?

11:01.100 --> 11:03.760
They seem to be getting along well.

11:04.080 --> 11:06.020
Good night, Shido!

11:06.020 --> 11:07.020
Natsuumi!

11:07.380 --> 11:08.840
Good night, Tohka!

11:08.840 --> 11:09.770
Natsuumi!

11:12.720 --> 11:14.080
Natsuumi...

11:14.080 --> 11:16.560
Another way to say, "I love you."

11:19.960 --> 11:21.530
I'm back, Kotori.

11:21.860 --> 11:24.540
Shidou, what were you doing?!

11:24.540 --> 11:27.040
Reine just contacted me!

11:27.440 --> 11:31.330
Tohka... Tohka just disappeared!

11:34.560 --> 11:35.960
Tohka! Tohka!

11:36.340 --> 11:37.960
Tohka!

11:38.360 --> 11:39.970
Tohka!

11:44.440 --> 11:45.510
Oh?

11:46.100 --> 11:50.180
You seem troubled, Shidou-kun.

11:50.460 --> 11:51.690
Natsumi!

11:52.040 --> 11:53.880
What choice did I have?

11:53.880 --> 11:57.060
It looked like you weren't coming home.

11:57.060 --> 12:02.360
So I figured that meant you didn't have a guess for tonight, and I had to take someone.

12:02.620 --> 12:04.110
Are you serious?

12:04.420 --> 12:07.620
But you know, I'm thinking about ending this game.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.870
End?! What does that mean?!

12:10.440 --> 12:15.380
If you can guess who I am tonight,
I'll return everyone I've made disappear.

12:16.080 --> 12:20.260
But if you can't, then I win.

12:20.260 --> 12:24.240
I'll stay transformed as that friend of yours forever.

12:24.240 --> 12:31.140
Meaning that one of your precious friends will cease to exist in this world.

12:31.740 --> 12:36.160
I'll come back at eleven thirty, just for you.

12:36.160 --> 12:37.520
Wait, Natsumi!

12:37.520 --> 12:38.900
Natsumi!

12:44.560 --> 12:45.410
I'll find out who you are.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.360
Just you watch!

12:48.360 --> 12:51.410
I'm going to save all of them!

12:53.240 --> 12:57.880
Shidou-kun's face gets more amusing the more friends of his I make disappear.

12:58.760 --> 13:00.680
But this isn't enough.

13:01.620 --> 13:04.300
I want to see more of your despair!

13:04.680 --> 13:08.160
That's the fate of anyone who sees my true form.

13:08.160 --> 13:10.680
Rot in your anguish.

13:11.720 --> 13:14.310
Nobody will ever find me.

13:15.320 --> 13:18.060
Nobody ever even tries.

13:25.600 --> 13:29.490
Hey there, Elliot. Been a while.

13:29.760 --> 13:34.500
Thirty years. Right, Ike?

13:40.160 --> 13:41.880
Now everyone's here.

13:42.380 --> 13:43.880
Shidou?

13:45.680 --> 13:49.640
Let me explain what's going on...

13:50.280 --> 13:53.520
I'm sorry for getting you all involved in this.

13:53.940 --> 13:56.060
Don't worry about it.

13:56.060 --> 14:00.240
You could've just told me about all of this when Yuzuru disappeared, though.

14:00.240 --> 14:05.900
I was disappointed when you told me that the date we went on was just a sort of check-up.

14:05.900 --> 14:10.530
I have a lot of questions for you,
but for now, I'll help you out.

14:10.800 --> 14:12.530
Thank you, everyone.

14:12.900 --> 14:15.060
I'll go over this again.

14:15.060 --> 14:18.420
Natsumi has transformed into one of these twelve people.

14:18.900 --> 14:20.920
The three people Shidou's guessed so far are

14:21.460 --> 14:24.920
Yoshino, Okamine-sensei, and Hazakura Mai.

14:24.920 --> 14:26.920
We can eliminate these three.

14:27.400 --> 14:35.140
So far Natsumi has taken Yuzuru, Yamabuki Ai,
Tonomachi Hiroto, Fujibakama Mii, and Tohka.

14:35.680 --> 14:38.140
She could still have transformed into one of these five.

14:38.680 --> 14:41.080
Then there's also the possibility she's one of us.

14:41.080 --> 14:46.650
We're the more likely suspects, but it'd be hard for her to transform into one of us.

14:46.650 --> 14:49.220
Huh? What do you mean by that?

14:49.220 --> 14:54.240
We're too high level, so it'd be hard for her to imitate us.

14:54.240 --> 14:56.880
Uh, yeah. Something like that.

14:56.880 --> 15:02.380
Why would "Witch," the spirit you're calling "Natsumi," take such a high risk?

15:03.160 --> 15:06.860
Every time someone in these pictures disappears,

15:06.860 --> 15:09.740
the chance of Shidou being right increases.

15:09.740 --> 15:11.970
It'd be hard for her to stay hidden until the end.

15:12.480 --> 15:15.440
Witch is confident she won't be found.

15:15.440 --> 15:19.730
She's surely made it so no matter how many guesses he takes, he'll never get it right.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.480
For example...

15:26.540 --> 15:29.740
She might have transformed into one of the pictures.

15:30.000 --> 15:34.530
That's true. We can't rule out that school of thought.

15:34.530 --> 15:39.060
Maybe she hasn't even transformed into anyone at all?

15:39.060 --> 15:41.040
I don't think that's likely.

15:41.600 --> 15:43.300
<i>Origami's right.</i>

15:43.300 --> 15:47.420
<i>She most likely found a loophole that makes it impossible to guess who she is.</i>

15:47.960 --> 15:51.520
<i>So that means she's one of these five people?</i>

15:52.930 --> 15:54.640
It's time.

16:00.390 --> 16:01.390
Natsumi!

16:02.000 --> 16:03.000
This is her?

16:03.000 --> 16:05.980
Oh my gosh, she's so pretty!

16:07.120 --> 16:08.360
Thank you.

16:08.360 --> 16:11.200
It's time for the final round.

16:11.200 --> 16:15.450
Do you think you can guess who I've transformed into today, Shidou-kun?

16:15.920 --> 16:17.480
I will!

16:17.480 --> 16:19.750
For your sake too, Natsumi!

16:20.900 --> 16:22.860
Give it your best shot.

16:22.860 --> 16:26.460
I'll give you three chances today.

16:26.460 --> 16:31.700
But for every wrong answer, I'll make one of your friends here disappear!

16:31.700 --> 16:35.930
Okay, Shidou-kun, let's hear your first guess.

16:36.760 --> 16:39.340
No matter how much I considered it,

16:39.340 --> 16:42.600
I couldn't find a reason why you'd be one of the four people here.

16:42.920 --> 16:48.110
There's no way you'd challenge me if you only have a twenty-five percent chance of winning.

16:51.600 --> 16:55.780
Which means you're among the five who have disappeared.

16:56.480 --> 16:58.900
You definitely chose a safe option—

16:58.900 --> 17:01.290
someone who wouldn't be chosen.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.040
And that's...

17:03.340 --> 17:05.290
The first one to disappear. Yuzuru, right?

17:06.800 --> 17:09.860
W-Wait! Yuzuru definitely wasn't a fake!

17:09.860 --> 17:12.670
There was nothing off about her at all!

17:15.340 --> 17:18.600
To be honest, I'm not entirely sure.

17:18.960 --> 17:23.270
But, if Yuzuru was Natsumi, everything fits—

17:23.270 --> 17:25.140
Oh, how unfortunate.

17:25.140 --> 17:26.650
Incorrect.

17:29.400 --> 17:30.540
Origami!

17:30.540 --> 17:32.780
Sh-She disappeared!

17:32.780 --> 17:35.040
What? She wasn't Yuzuru?

17:35.040 --> 17:36.780
I told you!

17:37.160 --> 17:41.540
All right you great detectives, who's next?

17:41.540 --> 17:45.600
If you don't guess soon, I'm going to make another one of them disappear.

17:48.300 --> 17:50.740
Elliot's on the move.

17:50.740 --> 17:53.590
You might need some backup of your own.

17:53.880 --> 17:58.840
Easier said than done. There's no one fit for the task among the Adeptus Numbers.

17:59.220 --> 18:00.920
Oh, but there is.

18:00.920 --> 18:06.230
There's a wizard who was able to put a scratch on you, remember?

18:06.720 --> 18:07.820
Damn it!

18:07.820 --> 18:09.120
Calm down, Shidou.

18:09.120 --> 18:10.730
You're definitely on the right track!

18:11.260 --> 18:12.920
<i>Who's Natsumi?!</i>

18:12.920 --> 18:13.610
<i>Who is she?!</i>

18:13.610 --> 18:16.940
There's no way we can guess right!

18:16.940 --> 18:18.610
There aren't any hints at all!

18:19.080 --> 18:21.520
Time's running out.

18:21.520 --> 18:25.000
Someone's going to disappear whether you guess or not.

18:25.360 --> 18:27.500
Then this guy!

18:27.920 --> 18:30.500
Oh, how unfortunate. Wrong answer again.

18:33.340 --> 18:34.340
Kaguya!

18:34.760 --> 18:37.820
It's your last chance.

18:37.820 --> 18:40.260
Who's it going to be?

18:40.780 --> 18:43.260
No, Darling! I can't take this!

18:43.600 --> 18:48.270
I don't want to disappear!
Not after I've met you, Darling!

18:48.600 --> 18:50.770
Calm down, Miku! Don't panic!

18:51.160 --> 18:53.440
Thirty seconds left.

18:54.620 --> 18:56.690
Please, Darling...

18:57.200 --> 18:58.440
take this.

18:58.440 --> 19:02.120
I don't want you to have nothing to remember me by!

19:02.120 --> 19:03.020
Miku!

19:03.020 --> 19:06.580
It's just going to disappear if I have it on me!

19:09.000 --> 19:11.160
<i>If she has it on her...</i>

19:11.160 --> 19:12.290
<i>It'll disappear too?</i>

19:18.300 --> 19:19.930
What are you doing, Shidou?

19:25.040 --> 19:27.060
I've got it, Natsumi.

19:27.060 --> 19:29.230
I know why you're so confident.

19:30.820 --> 19:34.640
You might be in one of these twelve pictures,

19:34.640 --> 19:36.360
but you're not one of these people.

19:38.820 --> 19:41.490
This is you, Natsumi!

19:42.120 --> 19:43.740
Isn't that right, Yoshinon?

19:46.860 --> 19:49.540
What? Why would Yoshinon be...

19:49.540 --> 19:52.120
Thinking back, I should've been suspicious.

19:52.800 --> 19:54.670
Yoshinon is Yoshino's puppet.

19:55.220 --> 19:58.380
But Yoshinon could see things that Yoshino couldn't.

20:00.280 --> 20:02.300
I only got it thanks to what Miku said.

20:02.980 --> 20:06.680
If Yoshino disappeared,
then Yoshinon would disappear too.

20:07.260 --> 20:09.100
So, am I right, Natsumi?

20:09.960 --> 20:12.100
Were you masquerading as Yoshinon?!

20:28.000 --> 20:29.620
They're back!

20:31.290 --> 20:32.920
Tohka!

20:32.920 --> 20:34.020
Shidou?

20:34.020 --> 20:34.960
Where are we?

20:34.960 --> 20:36.940
What happened?

20:36.940 --> 20:40.960
I feel like I just had the longest sleep of my life.

20:40.960 --> 20:43.680
Suspicion: What am I doing here?

20:43.680 --> 20:45.800
Yuzuru! Yuzuru!

20:45.800 --> 20:48.970
What a relief. You're all okay.

20:53.040 --> 20:54.480
Okay, Natsumi.

20:54.780 --> 20:58.480
Tell us why you did this.

21:03.040 --> 21:05.200
Is that really you, Natsumi?

21:08.830 --> 21:10.700
Haniel!

21:15.760 --> 21:17.100
I get it now.

21:17.100 --> 21:20.840
You used your Angel to transform.

21:20.840 --> 21:24.420
You, you, you little...

21:24.420 --> 21:27.090
You've discovered my secret not just once, but twice!

21:27.090 --> 21:30.160
You won't get away with this! I won't forgive you!

21:30.160 --> 21:32.350
I'm going to get all of you for this!

21:35.860 --> 21:38.460
Consider this a greeting, Itsuka Shidou.

21:38.460 --> 21:41.730
I will get my revenge on you!

21:42.160 --> 21:43.190
Wait, Natsumi!

21:43.190 --> 21:44.420
Let me talk—

21:47.760 --> 21:49.200
Shidou?

21:53.380 --> 21:54.120
Huh?

21:54.120 --> 21:57.440
The truth is absolute.

21:57.440 --> 22:00.080
Though the future is divergent.

22:00.080 --> 22:01.880
Which path will you choose?

22:01.880 --> 22:04.880
Huh?!!

22:05.420 --> 22:11.260
Let's make our last promise

22:05.420 --> 22:11.260
Kimi to saigo no yakusoku wo shiyou

22:23.640 --> 22:30.150
My heart was broken and locked up tight

22:23.640 --> 22:30.150
kizu darake no mama de shinai kondeta kokoro

22:30.150 --> 22:35.530
Yet you gently took it in your hands

22:30.150 --> 22:35.530
kimi wa sotto hiroiageta

22:35.530 --> 22:42.830
When the daily grind was leaving me feeling swept away

22:35.530 --> 22:42.830
kurikaesu hibi ni doushiyoumonaku utsumuita toki

22:42.830 --> 22:46.580
You held me close in your arms

22:42.830 --> 22:46.580
gyutto dakishimetekureta

22:46.580 --> 22:52.420
If I could have but one wish

22:46.580 --> 22:52.420
zutto koko de kimi to futari de

22:52.420 --> 22:57.890
I'd wish we could

22:52.420 --> 22:57.890
yozora nagareru

22:57.890 --> 23:01.140
Stay here watching the stars for eternity

22:57.890 --> 23:01.140
hoshi wo mitsuzuketeitai

23:01.140 --> 23:06.060
Let's make our last promise

23:01.140 --> 23:06.060
kimi to saigo no yakusoku wo shiyou

23:06.060 --> 23:12.360
Even if I alone were to disappear from this world

23:06.060 --> 23:12.360
sekai kara watashi dake kieteshimattemo

23:12.360 --> 23:14.400
You don't have to notice me

23:12.360 --> 23:14.400
kizukarenakute ii

23:14.400 --> 23:17.240
I want things to stay the way they are!

23:14.400 --> 23:17.240
konomama de itai!

23:17.240 --> 23:20.460
These feelings that I've found

23:17.240 --> 23:20.460
kizukareta kono kimochi

23:20.460 --> 23:25.050
Will last forever and ever

23:20.460 --> 23:25.050
itsumademo eien ni

23:35.180 --> 23:39.890
Episode 4

23:35.180 --> 23:39.890
Transformation
